        "url": "https://github.com/c933103/AN-Paint/pull/55#discussion_r4251568439",
        "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Update the handoff fallback count**\n\nWhen this integration is handed to the next maintainer, this “Current project handoff” still reports only 81 locales outside the 59-locale scope, while the merged picker and current contracts now contain 108 fallback locales. That undercounts the 27 newly offered empty catalogues and can lead subsequent scope or verification reporting to omit them; update this statement to match the 59-scoped/108-fallback inventory.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
      }
    ]
